/* Arcade chunk templates, stacked at random to build the endless climb.
 *
 * Each chunk is a maze 15 wide and CHUNK_H tall. The top and bottom rows are wall
 * except at three shared PORT columns, so any chunk stacks on any other and
 * the climb can never dead-end. tools/check-levels.mjs proves that every port
 * you can arrive at leads out of the top.
 *
 * Generated by tools/gen-levels.mjs, which throws away any candidate whose
 * slides run long — dense one-cell corridors are what make each swipe a
 * decision instead of a ride.
 */

